@TobiGr I addressed your review. While testing I noticed one thing which applies to both this PR and the latest version of NewPipe: when the app crashes, ACRA correctly receives the `Throwable`, and calls our handler which in turn calls `startActivity(Intent for ErrorActivity)`, but the `ErrorActivity` is never launched. I tried changing the intent flags, but nothing worked. This has to be investigated separately from this PR, using `git bisect` to detect the commit causing it if no other solution can be found. Could you please confirm the issue I'm describing also happens for you?

